Key a Claude account by user and organization.

Source: omacom/omarchy pull request 18681 (head 0d6d7c27a790), the bin/ part only; the
same change as pull request 16144, carried onto quattro. Commits f0ed1e80 and 80e6c0c0 by
Michele Di Giovanni (mikjkd), 0d6d7c27 by Omarchybot. License: as Omarchy (MIT).

Why here: the agents panel keys a Claude account by the claude.ai user alone, so one user in
two organizations (a personal plan and a Team) cannot add the second one ("That's Main ...").
Applied to /usr/bin with `patch -p1 -d /usr -F0` by linux/omarchy-patches-apply.
Retire this file once Omarchy ships the fix (see docs/omarchy-patches.md).

